    <briefdescription>
<para>Result of an XXE-hardened XML parse. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The document member is only valid when success is true.</para>
<para>XXE-safe XML parser wrapper.</para>
<para>Provides a thin wrapper around the underlying XML library that disables external entity expansion and DOCTYPE processing to prevent XML External Entity (XXE) injection attacks. </para>
